        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 7053SC, Rustic San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose is made out of wrought steel. Both the black steel finish and the satin steel finish highlight the texture of the piece, making it look like something straight from out of the old world. This Rustic San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose is available in a dummy function, a passage function for halls and closets, and a privacy function for bedrooms and bathrooms. It is easy to install and comes packaged as a complete set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Wrought Steel San Carlos Leverset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Castle San Carlos Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose is made out of wrought steel. Both the black steel finish and the satin steel finish highlight the texture of the piece, making it look like something straight from out of the old world. This Rustic San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose is available in a dummy function, a passage function for halls and closets, and a privacy function for bedrooms and bathrooms. It is easy to install and comes packaged as a complete set. \r\n",
                "keywords": "San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Rose, Wrought Steel San Carlos Leverset, Emtek 7053SC, Emtek 7103SC, Emtek 7253SC, square twist lever, twist lever, twisted leverset, authentic castle hardware, Door levers for castles, Rustic San Carlos Lever with Rectangular Roses, Castle San Carlos Leversets, Wrought Steel San Carlos Leverset with Rectangular Roses,"
